CHECK ui_fiji_panel_chooser_cancel PASS Cancel on the first chooser ended the plugin: cancelled, no run, no worker, no run record
NOTE ui_fiji_panel_copy_empty not run: LC_HOME already holds a last command (state/last_command.json), so the 'nothing to copy yet' state cannot be tested here
CHECK ui_fiji_panel_menu PASS Plugins > LabConstrictor holds ['labconstrictor tools'] (loose script)
NOTE ui_fiji_panel_chooser_app not run: not applicable: only one app is listed, so Fiji shows no app chooser
CHECK ui_fiji_panel_chooser_tool PASS lists ['Compare an image with a reference', 'Simulate imaging of a virtual sample']; the combo box, OK and Cancel are all it holds; each item selected and read back
CHECK ui_fiji_panel_chooser_ok PASS OK on the tool chooser opened 'Simulate imaging of a virtual sample'
CHECK ui_fiji_form_simulate_sample_opens PASS 38 parameter(s): every declared widget found and nothing else but OK and Cancel; inside the 1600x1000 screen; no other window or dialog
CHECK ui_fiji_form_simulate_sample_controls PASS 62 control(s) activated and read back: choice_combo, file_browse, flag_checkbox, number_spinner, set_checkbox, slider, text_field
CHECK ui_fiji_panel_form_cancel PASS Cancel on the form ended the plugin: cancelled, no run, no worker, no run record
CHECK ui_fiji_run_simulate_sample PASS status COMPLETE; every declared result shown (simulated:image, noiseless:image, values:values); inputs from case {"random_seed": 1}
CHECK ui_fiji_panel_log PASS the Log window holds the run's command line and Python snippet, equal to the saved last command
CHECK ui_fiji_panel_form_ok PASS a real click on OK closed the form and the plugin ran the tool (status COMPLETE)
CHECK ui_fiji_screens_simulate_sample PASS the form and after-run screenshots exist, are fresh and plausible (evidence for a person, not a check of the picture)
CHECK ui_fiji_panel_copy_terminal PASS the clipboard holds the terminal line of the last run (VLab4Mic: simulate_sample), equal to the saved command
CHECK ui_fiji_panel_copy_python PASS the clipboard holds the Python snippet of the last run (VLab4Mic: simulate_sample), equal to the saved command
NOTE ui_fiji_fj1b_cancel_form not run: no tool of this app has a required file/folder/table input on a form of several parameters: nothing to cancel with an empty required path
NOTE ui_fiji_fj1b_missing_image not run: no tool of this app has a required image input: nothing to refuse
CHECK ui_fiji_controls_all_known PASS 167 control(s) in 2 form(s) and 3 chooser(s), every one in the control table (20 kinds)
